            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure content relates to (1) several antenna units used by being attached to window glass for a building comprising a radiating element arranged so that a matching member is interposed between the window glass and the radiating element, and a conductor arranged so that the radiating element is interposed between the matching member and the conductor, (2) an antenna unit-attached window glass comprising one of said antenna units and the window glass, and (3) several matching bodies used by being sandwiched between window glass for a building and one of said antenna units.</p>
            </abstract>
